{"unit_id": "taxueseek__dsh-snippets#feature-1", "repo": "taxueseek/dsh-snippets", "commit": "92c9aaa803f2c7476543aff7d098df737e1e152d", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-snippets** 的功能「保存片段」：通过 snippet_save 按短名称保存命令、代码、网址或提示词，可附加标签；同名再次保存会覆盖旧内容并更新时间，正文不能为空且受字符上限约束。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["src/index.ts:111-127", "src/index.ts:173-212"]}
{"unit_id": "taxueseek__dsh-snippets#feature-2", "repo": "taxueseek/dsh-snippets", "commit": "92c9aaa803f2c7476543aff7d098df737e1e152d", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-snippets** 的功能「搜索片段」：调用 snippet_search 可按名称、正文或标签做不区分大小写的子串搜索，也可限定标签和结果数量；结果按更新时间从新到旧排列。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["src/index.ts:134-152", "src/index.ts:214-253"]}
{"unit_id": "taxueseek__dsh-snippets#feature-3", "repo": "taxueseek/dsh-snippets", "commit": "92c9aaa803f2c7476543aff7d098df737e1e152d", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-snippets** 的功能「取回与管理」：用 snippet_get 按确切名称取回单条内容，snippet_delete 删除指定片段，snippet_count 返回当前条目数；删除不存在的名称会报告未删除。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["src/index.ts:129-132", "src/index.ts:154-162", "src/index.ts:256-330"]}
{"unit_id": "taxueseek__dsh-snippets#feature-4", "repo": "taxueseek/dsh-snippets", "commit": "92c9aaa803f2c7476543aff7d098df737e1e152d", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-snippets** 的功能「本地 JSONL 持久化」：工具初始化时从配置目录加载 snippets.jsonl，保存或删除后写入临时文件再重命名；加载时跳过空行、损坏行和字段不合格的记录。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["src/index.ts:65-109", "src/index.ts:154-157"]}
